{% if isFramework("react") %}

The props passed to the custom filter component follow the `CustomFilterDisplayProps` interface, listed below under [API Reference](#api-reference).

```jsx
export default ({ model, onModelChange, getValue }) => {
    return (
        <div>
            <input
                type="text"
                value={model || ''}
                onChange={({ target: { value }}) => onModelChange(value === '' ? null : value)}
            />
        </div>
    );
}
```

{% /if %}
